  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">P4R Economic Advisor (Programme Funded Role)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This role provides economic expertise to support inclusive growth and economic resilience across programme activities. The adviser helps programme teams understand economic conditions, policy constraints and reform opportunities, and supports the design of interventions that improve economic governance and reduce vulnerability to external shocks.
The role contributes analysis and advice to ensure activities are economically sound, deliver value for money and align with development objectives. It also supports engagement with economic stakeholders, helps assess risks, and promotes learning on what works in complex economic environments.
Through informed economic advice, this role helps ensure that development interventions contribute to sustainable livelihoods, inclusive growth and long-term resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
